{"jobs":[{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/invisibletech/jobs/4997999101","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":4532056101,"location":{"name":"United States - Remote"},"metadata":[{"id":7403005101,"name":"Priority","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12185434101,"name":"Language Proficiency","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":12400224101,"name":"Marketplace Website - Job Cards","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12446740101,"name":"Unique Role Location","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":4997999101,"updated_at":"2026-11-09T15:55:03-05:00","requisition_id":"2237","title":"Contract Technical Recruiter","company_name":"Invisible Technologies","first_published":"2026-10-05T22:28:08-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is an Applied AI research company closing the gap between frontier models and the enterprise. We provide the platform infrastructure that makes AI work in production at scale: unify fragmented data, map complex processes, orchestrate and evaluate agents, and stand up hyper-personalized workflow applications fast for companies like Grubhub, Alliance Global, and Thomson Reuters. Where models fall short, we build RL environments and data to fix them. The result: a virtuous cycle between enterprise deployment and model training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recognized as Best Predictive Analytics Platform of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards, Invisible makes AI work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Contract Technical Talent Acquisition Partner, you will play a mission-critical role in scaling Invisible’s technical talent pipeline. In this engagement, you’ll be responsible for building and maintaining evergreen pipelines of world-class engineers across data engineering, machine learning, and full stack development. These engineers are deployed in our forward deployed engineering teams—elite squads embedded directly with customers to build transformative AI-powered solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This engagement requires proactive pipeline development, seamless coordination with sales and delivery leads &amp;amp; Field CTOs and a deep understanding of technical talent acquisition in a fast-scaling, customer-responsive environment. Your success will ensure that Invisible is always ready to deploy top engineering talent the moment opportunity strikes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a 3 to 6 month contract engagement at approximately 40 hours per week, with the potential to extend based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain robust, high-quality candidate pipelines for evergreen roles across data engineering, machine learning, and full stack development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with sales, delivery, and engineering leadership to forecast hiring needs tied to customer deployments and revenue pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute outbound sourcing strategies to identify and engage top-tier candidates across key technical domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish candidate readiness protocols so that qualified engineers are pre-vetted and able to accept offers at short notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end hiring processes, ensuring fast, smooth, and high-quality candidate experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and insights to continuously optimize sourcing channels, screening processes, and pipeline conversion rates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build campaigns which ensure vetted candidates are constantly engaged with the Invisible brand, ready and willing to start in short notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to define technical role requirements, assessment frameworks, and success profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Invisible as a talent brand ambassador across technical communities and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in full-cycle technical recruiting experience, with deep expertise in sourcing and hiring engineering talent across data, ML, and software development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building evergreen or just-in-time pipelines in high-growth, high-demand environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting forward deployed or professional services-style teams is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, especially across sales, product, and engineering organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward action: you are proactive, resourceful, and thrive in dynamic, rapidly evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, prioritization, and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ATS platforms (ideally Greenhouse) sourcing tools, and data-driven recruiting strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bonus and equity is included in all full-time, non commission offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What It&#39;s Like to Work at Invisible:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Invisible, we’re not just redefining work—we’re reinventing it. We operate at the intersection of advanced AI and human ingenuity, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible to unlock productivity and scale. Ownership is at the core of everything we do. Here, you won’t just execute tasks—you’ll build, innovate, and shape the future alongside world-class clients pushing the boundaries of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We expect bold ideas, relentless drive, and the ability to turn ambiguity into opportunity. The pace is fast, the challenges are big, and the growth is unmatched. We’re not for everyone, and we’re okay with that. If you’re looking for predictable routines, this isn’t the place for you. But if you’re driven to create, thrive in dynamic environments, and want a front-row seat to the AI revolution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;Invisible is a hybrid organization with offices and team members located around the world. While some roles may offer remote flexibility, most positions involve in-office collaboration and are tied to specific locations. Any location-based requirements or hybrid expectations will be communicated by our Talent Acquisition team during the recruiting process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;AI Interviewing Guidelines:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Our hiring team thoughtfully uses AI to support an efficient, engaging, and inclusive interview process. Since AI can also be a helpful tool for candidates, we&#39;ve outlined expectations for using it ethically throughout your interview journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Click here to learn more about how we use AI and our guidelines for candidates.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accessibility Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 73, 94);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for individuals with disabilities. If you require an accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, please submit your request using our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation request form.&lt;/a&gt; A member of our team will follow up to support your request.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4012501101,"name":"Talent","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4048530101}],"offices":[{"id":4020882101,"name":"United States - Remote","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://s101.recruiting.eu.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/4997999101/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/invisibletech/jobs/5018596101","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":4542770101,"location":{"name":"New York - Hybrid"},"metadata":[{"id":7403005101,"name":"Priority","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12185434101,"name":"Language Proficiency","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":12400224101,"name":"Marketplace Website - Job Cards","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12446740101,"name":"Unique Role Location","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":5018596101,"updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:26:19-05:00","requisition_id":"2244","title":"Corporate Counsel","company_name":"Invisible Technologies","first_published":"2026-10-28T16:23:39-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is an Applied AI research company closing the gap between frontier models and the enterprise. We provide the platform infrastructure that makes AI work in production at scale: unify fragmented data, map complex processes, orchestrate and evaluate agents, and stand up hyper-personalized workflow applications fast for companies like Grubhub, Alliance Global, and Thomson Reuters. Where models fall short, we build RL environments and data to fix them. The result: a virtuous cycle between enterprise deployment and model training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recognized as Best Predictive Analytics Platform of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards, Invisible makes AI work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is seeking an exceptional Corporate Counsel to play a central role in navigating legal, corporate, and strategic matters at a rapidly scaling global AI company.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is not a traditional corporate counsel role focused on routine legal execution&lt;/strong&gt;. We are looking for a commercially sophisticated attorney who combines exceptional legal judgment with the ability to navigate complex matters.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Legal Officer, you will be a key member of the legal team and a trusted adviser to senior leadership, with meaningful exposure to the CEO, founder, and board. You will take ownership of legal matters spanning corporate governance, equity and capital structure, strategic transactions, international expansion, and enterprise risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We value demonstrated capability and judgment over years of experience alone.&lt;/strong&gt; The defining qualities of the successful candidate include the ability to anticipate issues, challenge assumptions, assess legal and commercial considerations, formulate sound and defensible recommendations and drive matters through to resolution in collaboration with the CLO and executive leadership. The successful candidate will bring intellectual rigor, sound judgment, and a strong ownership mentality, with the confidence to operate as a genuine strategic partner to the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a unique opportunity to operate at the intersection of corporate law, emerging technology, and executive decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on corporate governance matters, working closely with the CLO, CEO, executive leadership and Board on significant corporate decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of key legal workstreams supporting Board and committee activities, driving matters forward with sound judgment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capital Structure, Equity &amp;amp; Strategic Transactions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of legal matters relating to the company&#39;s capital strategy and equity incentive programs, advising on structure, incentive arrangements, shareholder rights, and related legal considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with CLO, CFO and executive leadership on financing and strategic transactions and compliance with such arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive key legal workstreams in connection with strategic corporate transactions, including M&amp;amp;A, investments, restructurings, and other major corporate initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Corporate Strategy &amp;amp; Expansion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with finance, tax, and business leadership to evaluate and implement international expansion and operating structures, balancing legal, regulatory, tax and commercial considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on cross-border corporate matters and develop scalable legal frameworks to support the company&#39;s evolving global footprint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory, Risk &amp;amp; Intellectual Property&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide legal guidance on corporate compliance, privacy, export controls, foreign investment considerations, and other applicable regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on intellectual property ownership, protection, and commercialization, including matters relating to proprietary technology, data, and strategic commercial arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop pragmatic, risk-based solutions that enable the business to pursue strategic opportunities while protecting its long-term interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise internal stakeholders on complex and novel legal matters, translating legal risks into clear business options and actionable recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;J.D. from an accredited U.S. law school and active membership in good standing with a U.S. state bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–10+ years of corporate legal experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including substantial experience at an Am Law 100 or equivalent firm. Demonstrated capability and commerciality matter more than tenure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in corporate governance, capital structures, equity compensation, shareholder matters, financings, M&amp;amp;A, credit facilities, international restructurings, or other strategic transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to take ownership of high-stakes legal matters end-to-end, exercising sound judgment, delivering commercially defensible advice, and driving execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional commercial acumen and analytical skills, with the ability to navigate competing risks, ambiguity, and fast-moving business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thorough and extremely detail-oriented, strong drafting and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual curiosity, initiative and ownership, with a low-ego, collaborative approach and willingness to balance strategic advice with hands-on execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior in-house experience at a high-growth, venture-backed, private equity-backed, or global technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with enterprise AI, SaaS, technology transactions, data licensing, intellectual property, and emerging AI regulatory frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising on cross-border corporate structures and coordinating legal matters across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s In It For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is committed to fair and competitive pay, ensuring that compensation reflects both market conditions and the value each team member brings. Our salary structure accounts for regional differences in cost of living while maintaining internal equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this position, the annual salary range is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$250,000 - $300,000 USD base salary&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bonus and equity is included in all full-time, non commission offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What It&#39;s Like to Work at Invisible:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;At Invisible, we’re not just redefining work—we’re reinventing it. We operate at the intersection of advanced AI and human ingenuity, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible to unlock productivity and scale. Ownership is at the core of everything we do. Here, you won’t just execute tasks—you’ll build, innovate, and shape the future alongside world-class clients pushing the boundaries of AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;We expect bold ideas, relentless drive, and the ability to turn ambiguity into opportunity. The pace is fast, the challenges are big, and the growth is unmatched. We’re not for everyone, and we’re okay with that. If you’re looking for predictable routines, this isn’t the place for you. But if you’re driven to create, thrive in dynamic environments, and want a front-row seat to the AI revolution, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;Invisible is a hybrid organization with offices and team members located around the world. While some roles may offer remote flexibility, most positions involve in-office collaboration and are tied to specific locations. Any location-based requirements or hybrid expectations will be communicated by our Talent Acquisition team during the recruiting process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;AI Interviewing Guidelines:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Our hiring team thoughtfully uses AI to support an efficient, engaging, and inclusive interview process. Since AI can also be a helpful tool for candidates, we&#39;ve outlined expectations for using it ethically throughout your interview journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(35, 111, 161);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.invisible.co/ai-interview-guidelines&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Click here to learn more about how we use AI and our guidelines for candidates.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Accessibility Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(52, 73, 94);&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are committed to providing reasonable accommodations for individuals with disabilities. If you require an accommodation to participate in the application or interview process, please submit your request using our &lt;a target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation request form.&lt;/a&gt; A member of our team will follow up to support your request.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;color: rgb(85, 85, 85);&quot;&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;","departments":[{"id":4030559101,"name":"Legal","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4048530101}],"offices":[{"id":4021356101,"name":"New York","location":"New York, United States","child_ids":[],"parent_id":4027310101},{"id":4020882101,"name":"United States - Remote","location":null,"child_ids":[],"parent_id":null}],"ai_disclaimer":null,"include_ai_disclaimer":false,"ai_opt_out_request_url":"http://s101.recruiting.eu.greenhouse.io/ai_opt_out_request/job_post/5018596101/ai_opt_out"},{"absolute_url":"https://job-boards.eu.greenhouse.io/invisibletech/jobs/5010072101","data_compliance":[{"type":"gdpr","requires_consent":false,"requires_processing_consent":false,"requires_retention_consent":false,"retention_period":null,"demographic_data_consent_applies":false}],"internal_job_id":4539276101,"location":{"name":"New York - Hybrid; San Francisco Bay Area - Hybrid"},"metadata":[{"id":7403005101,"name":"Priority","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12185434101,"name":"Language Proficiency","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"},{"id":12400224101,"name":"Marketplace Website - Job Cards","value":null,"value_type":"single_select"},{"id":12446740101,"name":"Unique Role Location","value":null,"value_type":"multi_select"}],"id":5010072101,"updated_at":"2026-10-22T16:26:53-04:00","requisition_id":"2242","title":"Director of Engineering, Data Labs","company_name":"Invisible Technologies","first_published":"2026-10-19T11:36:24-04:00","language":"en","application_deadline":null,"content":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Invisible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is an Applied AI research company closing the gap between frontier models and the enterprise. We provide the platform infrastructure that makes AI work in production at scale: unify fragmented data, map complex processes, orchestrate and evaluate agents, and stand up hyper-personalized workflow applications fast for companies like Grubhub, Alliance Global, and Thomson Reuters. Where models fall short, we build RL environments and data to fix them. The result: a virtuous cycle between enterprise deployment and model training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Recognized as Best Predictive Analytics Platform of the Year at the 2026 AI Breakthrough Awards, Invisible makes AI work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director of Engineering to set the technical strategy for Data Labs, the team that builds the benchmarking systems, data pipelines, and RL environments behind our AI training engagements. The frontier labs and enterprises we work with are changing how they train, evaluate, and deploy models every quarter. Your job is to see where that market is going and make sure Data Labs is built for it before our clients ask.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll decide which capabilities we invest in, which we standardize into platform, and which we leave to individual engagements. You&#39;ll track how training methods, evaluation practices, and data needs are shifting across the industry, and turn that into a technical roadmap and a point of view our commercial and research teams can sell against.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead a group of engineering managers, forward deployed engineers (FDEs), and senior ICs, and partner closely with applied research, product, and go-to-market leadership. This is a hands-on strategic role. You won&#39;t spend much time writing code, but you&#39;ll stay close enough to the technical work to make and defend hard architectural calls, and close enough to clients to know which calls matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the multi-year technical strategy for Data Labs, and translate it into a roadmap tied to where the AI training and evaluation market is heading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decide where to build shared platform versus engagement-specific solutions, weighing reuse against team autonomy so platforms speed teams up rather than creating over-dependency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set architectural direction for benchmarking infrastructure, data pipelines, and RL environments so they stay reproducible, portable across client deployments, and ready for the next generation of training methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical shifts 6–18 months out, such as new post-training techniques, agentic evaluation, and synthetic data, and place the bets that keep Invisible ahead of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set expectations for how AI is used in design reviews and day-to-day engineering work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Intelligence &amp;amp; Competitive Positioning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a clear, current view of how frontier labs and enterprises are training, evaluating, and deploying models, and what that means for the data and infrastructure they&#39;ll need from us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the competitive landscape across AI data, evaluation, and RL environment providers, and help define where Invisible differentiates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn client signals, research developments, and market trends into investment recommendations for executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and commercial teams to shape new offerings, pricing logic, and the technical story behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluation &amp;amp; Data Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define Invisible&#39;s point of view on benchmarking and evaluation, including pre- and post-engagement comparisons, capability gap analyses, and regression tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure evaluation design ties to client-defined success metrics, validate automated checks against human judgment, and be explicit about what each approach can&#39;t see.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify reusable data assets, frameworks, and pipelines that become durable advantages and improve margins across engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape practices for data licensing, privacy, and contamination risk as a strategic differentiator, not just a compliance requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Executive Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent engineering in executive conversations, strategic client relationships, and pre-sales, translating technical reality into clear, honest narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted technical advisor to client research and engineering leaders, bringing back what you learn to inform the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help leaders weigh client-specific asks against broader platform and business goals, with clear short- and long-term paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow an engineering org of multiple teams, including engineering managers, senior managers, FDEs, and Staff+ ICs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach managers to build sound technical judgment and strategic awareness in their teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build hiring pipelines that reinforce a rigorous, client-focused, strategy-aware engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the org has the planning, quality, and operational practices it needs to execute on the strategy reliably, delegating day-to-day delivery to strong managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in software engineering, with significant experience building ML or AI systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in engineering leadership, including experience managing managers across multiple teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of setting multi-year technical strategy and making platform investment decisions that paid off commercially.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, current understanding of the AI training and evaluation landscape, including how frontier labs and enterprises approach fine-tuning, RLHF/RLAIF, and evaluation methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on familiarity with LLM training pipelines, deep enough to make and defend architectural decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building benchmarking, data curation, or RL infrastructure that produced measurable client outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read market and competitive signals and turn them into a technical roadmap and a clear product point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional partnership with applied research, product, and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent executive communication, and confidence acting as a technical advisor in client and pre-sales conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at an AI services firm, applied research consultancy, frontier lab, or enterprise AI product company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A visible point of view on the AI data and evaluation market, such as talks, writing, or open-source work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data licensing, synthetic data generation, or contamination detection involving client data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shaping new product lines or service offerings from a technical foundation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading an org through rapid growth or significant change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s In It For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Invisible is committed to fair and competitive pay, ensuring that compensation reflects both market conditions and the value each team member brings. Our salary structure accounts for regional differences in cost of living while maintaining internal equity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this position, the annual salary will include a 20% annual bonus and an additional incentive structure. The base salary range for SF/NY are:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$300,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bonus and equity is included in all full-time, non commission offers. Final compensation is determined by a combination of factors, including location, job-related experience, skills, knowledge, internal pay equity, and overall market conditions. Because of this, every offer is unique. Additional details on total compensation and benefits will be discussed during the hiring process.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can find more information about our geographic pay tiers&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://invisibletech.ai/compensation-and-pay-tiers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; During the interview process, your Invisible Talent Acquisition Partner will confirm which tier applies to your location. For candidates outside the U.S., compensation is adjusted to reflect local market conditions and cost of living.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What It&#39;s Like to Work at Invisible:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
